# Control cell C3: ArcMutex · String · rodata literal · no-spawn · always exit 0.
#
# The String rodata literal has cap=0, so the runtime `gorget_string_free`
# short-circuits and no double-free is possible even if follow-through were
# missing. This is why the entire corpus historically sampled ONLY this cell
# for `shared String` and the ICE hid for months.

void main():
    shared String s = "hello"
    print(s)
